{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"{\"facts\":[{\"fact\":\"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\"},{\"fact\":\"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠是仓管\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠把这批荔枝从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"},{\"fact\":\"司机回复\"知道了\"\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"司机回了一句\"知道了\"\"},{\"fact\":\"司机把已经发动的货车熄了火\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"},{\"fact\":\"渗出的水顺着托盘流到地面\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"},{\"fact\":\"裴小棠去拿拖把\",\"status\":\"已发生\",\"evidence\":\"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"}]}","reasoning_content":"Let me analyze this short chapter carefully to extract all facts.\n\nThe chapter describes:\n1. A cold storage temperature controller tripped before noon\n2. A whole box of lychees started leaking water\n3. Warehouse manager Pei Xiaotang changed the batch status from \"pending shipment\" to \"damaged goods\"\n4. Pei Xiaotang notified the driver to cancel the afternoon trip to Gangdong wholesale market\n5. The driver replied \"got it\"\n6. The driver turned off the already-started truck\n7. Water seeped out along the pallet onto the floor\n8. Pei Xiaotang went to get a mop\n\nLet me extract each fact individually:\n\n1. The cold storage temperature controller tripped before noon - 已发生\n2. The whole box of lychees started leaking water - 已发生\n3. Pei Xiaotang is a warehouse manager (仓管) - 已发生 (identity)\n4. Pei Xiaotang changed the batch from \"pending shipment\" to \"damaged goods\" - 已发生\n5. Pei Xiaotang notified the driver to cancel the afternoon trip to Gangdong wholesale market - 已发生 (speech act)\n6. The driver replied \"got it\" - 已发生\n7. The driver turned off the already-started truck - 已发生\n8. Water seeped along the pallet onto the floor - 已发生\n9. Pei Xiaotang went to get a mop - 已发生\n\nLet me check for any plans, conditions, speculations, negations, etc. I don't see any.\n\nLet me also check: the afternoon trip to Gangdong wholesale market was planned but got cancelled. The cancellation is the key event. The original plan to go to Gangdong is implied but the cancellation is what's stated.\n\nLet me refine and make sure each fact has proper evidence.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1787764117,"id":"chatcmpl-67e04b3e-881e-90c8-b239-3852c8ea974b","model":"qwen3.8-max","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":689,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":402,"text_tokens":689},"prompt_tokens":1619,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1024,"text_tokens":1619},"total_tokens":2308}}